<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 04:15:00 GMT</pubDate>
<link>https://cincodias.elpais.com/companias/2026-11-09/iberdrola-llevara-su-batalla-judicial-contra-el-testigo-clave-del-caso-villarejo-ante-el-tribunal-constitucional.html</link>
